private company (私人公司) means a company (whether incorporated in or outside Hong Kong)
                that is not allowed to issue any invitations to the public to subscribe for any
                shares or debentures of the company;

immovable property (不動產) means—(a)land (whether covered by water or not);(b)any estate, right, interest or easement in or over any land;
